ll, "earn": false, "q": "Grocery is one of the hardest things to get right online. Someone has to pick a ripe avocado, find a substitute you’d choose yourself, and get the ice cream to you before it melts,", "a": "said Tony Xu, co-founder and CEO of DoorDash", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1579091/000119312526437075/d171568dex991.htm"}, {"d": "2026-10-29", "n": 4.27, "z": null, "rz": -2.6, "earn": true, "q": "Q3 was our best quarter as a public company, with GTV up 15% year-over-year and advertising and other revenue up 23% year-over-year. Our fundamentals keep getting stronger, with solid consumer demand, deepening customer engagement, and expanding profitability,", "a": "said Chris Rogers, CEO", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1579091/000119312526437014/d24470dex991.htm"}, {"d": "2026-08-06", "n": 3.62, "z": null, "rz": -1.05, "earn": true, "q": "Our business is performing incredibly well. We’ve meaningfully accelerated our growth over the past three quarters, including a strong Q2 where we grew GTV 14% year-over-year. We're attracting and engaging more customers across our marketplace and enterprise platform, which creates more value for retailers, brands, and…", "a": "said Chris Rogers, CEO. \"We're continuing to improve the customer experience on our leading online grocery marketplace, accelerate adoption ", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1579091/000157909126000040/q22026pressrelease.htm"}, {"d": "2026-05-06", "n": 3.08, "z": null, "rz": -1.19, "earn": true, "q": "Q1 was a milestone quarter — surpassing $10 billion in GTV and $1 billion in total revenue for the first time. These results prove that our strategy is working. We’re the leading grocery technology platform, delivering a best-in-class consumer experience, powering retailers across marketplace and enterprise, and operat…", "a": "said Chris Rogers, CEO. “Each part of our platform is getting stronger — and they’re compounding together. That foundation positions us to i", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1579091/000157909126000032/q12026pressrelease.htm"}, {"d": "2025-08-15", "n": 3.68, "z": null, "rz": null, "earn": false, "q": "Josh is a proven marketplace innovator with a track record of scaling consumer platforms such as Etsy, Evite, and Skype,", "a": "said Chris Rogers, Instacart’s Chief Executive Officer", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1579091/000157909125000071/q3boardannouncementpressre.htm"}, {"d": "2024-04-16", "n": 1.94, "z": null, "rz": null, "earn": false, "q": "Victoria's decades of experience and deep understanding of the CPG and retail industries will be invaluable as we continue to introduce new technology solutions for our partners. We have a bold vision to build the technologies that power every single grocery transaction, and Victoria’s expertise will be an incredible a…", "a": "said Instacart CEO and Chair Fidji Simo", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1579091/000157909124000039/victoriadolan_bodupdates-p.htm"}], "now": null}, "score": {"value": 52, "verdict": {"it": "Nessuna convinzione chiara", "en": "No clear conviction"}, "confidence": "Media", "covered_pct": 80, "missing": ["guid"], "subs": [{"id": "insider", "name": {"it": "Insider", "en": "Insiders"}, "w": 35, "v": 49, "why": [{"it": "Nessun acquisto discrezionale negli ultimi 90 giorni.", "en": "No discretionary purchase in the last 90 days."}, {"it": "Flusso netto pesato sullo storico: -0.52 M$.", "en": "Net flow weighted by track record: -0.52 M$."}, {"it": "18 operazioni escluse perché non informative (piani 10b5-1, ritenute fiscali, esercizi e assegnazioni).", "en": "18 transactions excluded as uninformative (10b5-1 plans, tax withholding, exercises and awards)."}], "coverage": "Alta"}, {"id": "guid", "name": {"it": "Guidance e tono", "en": "Guidance and tone"}, "w": 20, "v": null, "why": [{"it": "Serve l'export delle trascrizioni delle call.", "en": "Needs the export of the earnings-cal